    "show_share": true,
    "description": "What does give back mean? How do we take care of our mental health? How should one stay busy during the pandemic? Dr Arish Haider's talk, 'Life in a rut- Graduated and Pandemic hit!' addressed these questions, amongst others, to an audience of 180+ students from various medical colleges on Wednesday. Alumnus of the Class of 2018, Dr Arish Haider is also the ex-convener of Surgery Interest Group (SIG), which organized this inspirational talk.",
